### =============================================================================
### Municipal Complaint Prioritization System - API Collection
### =============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Authentication & Registration
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Register Citizen 1
# @name registerCitizen1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "alice.citizen@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Alice Johnson",
  "phone": "+1-555-0101"
}

### 1.2 Register Citizen 2 (for upvoting)
# @name registerCitizen2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "bob.citizen@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Bob Miller",
  "phone": "+1-555-0102"
}

### 1.3 Login as Citizen 1
# @name loginCitizen1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "alice.citizen@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Save Citizen Token
@citizenToken = {{loginCitizen1.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1.4 Login as Admin (created via BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_* env vars)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@municipal.gov",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

### Save Admin Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Reference Data
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Get All Departments (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/departments

### 2.2 Get Department by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/departments/1


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Admin User Management
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Create Field Officer for Roads Department (Zone 1)
# @name createOfficer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/officers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "email": "officer.roads@municipal.gov",
  "password": "OfficerPassword123!",
  "fullName": "Officer Marcus Vance",
  "phone": "+1-555-0199",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "zoneId": 1
}

### Save Officer ID
@officerId = {{createOfficer.response.body.id}}

### 3.2 Login as Field Officer
# @name loginOfficer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "officer.roads@municipal.gov",
  "password": "OfficerPassword123!"
}

### Save Officer Token
@officerToken = {{loginOfficer.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3.3 List All Field Officers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/officers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Complaint Reporting & Life-Cycle
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Submit High-Severity Pothole Complaint (Severity 5 -> Instant +50 Boost)
# @name submitComplaint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

{
  "title": "Severe Cave-in Pothole on Oak Avenue",
  "description": "Deep 3-foot pothole exposing water piping, creating severe hazard for vehicles and pedestrians.",
  "category": "POTHOLE",
  "severity": 5,
  "zoneId": 1,
  "latitude": 37.774929,
  "longitude": -122.419416,
  "address": "450 Oak Avenue, Zone 1",
  "photoUrl": "https://storage.civic.gov/evidence/oak_pothole_01.jpg"
}

### Save Complaint ID
@complaintId = {{submitComplaint.response.body.id}}

### 4.2 Fetch Dynamic Priority Queue (Sorted by Priority Score Descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints/priority?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### 4.3 Get Specific Complaint Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### 4.4 Citizen 2 Login & Upvote Complaint
# @name loginCitizen2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "bob.citizen@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

@citizen2Token = {{loginCitizen2.response.body.accessToken}}

### Upvote Complaint (Increases Affected Count & Recalculates Score)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}/upvote
Authorization: Bearer {{citizen2Token}}


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Dispatch, Assignment & Status Pipeline
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Admin Assigns Complaint to Field Officer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}/assign
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "officerId": {{officerId}},
  "notes": "Urgent critical hazard. Proceed with asphalt crew immediately."
}

### 5.2 Officer Updates Status to IN_PROGRESS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "remarks": "Asphalt repair crew dispatched to site. Traffic cones placed.",
  "proofPhotoUrl": "https://storage.civic.gov/work/oak_in_progress.jpg"
}

### 5.3 Officer Resolves Complaint with Proof of Work
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "remarks": "Pothole filled and leveled. Surface sealed. Road open to traffic.",
  "proofPhotoUrl": "https://storage.civic.gov/work/oak_resolved.jpg"
}

### 5.4 View Complaint Status History Audit Trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### 5.5 Reporting Citizen Submits Resolution Feedback (Closes Ticket)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}/feedback
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comments": "Fixed within hours! Excellent work by the road repair crew."
}


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Analytics & Turnaround Reports
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Get Live Municipal Analytics Summary (Admin / Officer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Actuator & Health Probes
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness

### 7.2 Readiness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness
